{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":21,"recognized_text":"1. 【答案】−f'(0)/2 【解析】令分子减 f(0) 并用导数定义，原式=f'(0)·lim(1−cos x)/ln(1−x sin x)=−f'(0)/2。\n2. 【答案】A：g(a)=0 【解析】若 g(a)≠0，则由 F=gφ 可反推出 φ 在 a 可导，矛盾；故 g(a)=0，且 F'(a)=g'(a)φ(a)。\n3. 【答案】D：−1/2 【解析】令 Δx=x−2，则 ln(1+Δx)/[Δx·f(1−Δx)]→2，故 1/f(1)=2f'(1)，f'(1)=−1/2。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":21}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":22,"recognized_text":"4. 【答案】4 【解析】f²(x)−2=[f(x)+√2][f(x)−f(0)]，极限为 2√2 f'(0)=4。\n5. 【答案】1 【解析】由 1/(n+1)²≤x<1/n² 得 n²≤f(x)<(n+1)²，夹逼得 f(x)/x→1 (x→0+)，故右导数为1。\n6. 【答案】f'(0)/f(0) 【解析】把 n ln[f(1/n)/f(0)] 写成 [ln f(x)−ln f(0)]/x，x=1/n→0+，得 f'(0)/f(0)。\n7. 【答案】B：f(0)=0,f'(0)≠0 【解析】若 f(0)≠0，|f| 在邻域内等于 ±f 可导；不可导只能 f(0)=0 且 f'(0)≠0。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":22}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":23,"recognized_text":"8. 【答案】y=2x−1 【解析】连续性给 f(1)=1，导数 f'(1)=lim[(f(x)−1)/(x−1)]=2，切线 y−1=2(x−1)。\n9. 【答案】D：0 【解析】Δf(1)=f(1+Δx)−f(1)，df(1)=f'(1)Δx，差商趋于0。\n10. 【答案】D：可导且连续 【解析】左右导数均为0，且导函数两侧分别为 3x²sin(1/x)−x cos(1/x) 与2x，均趋0，故可导且导函数连续。\n11. 【答案】A：充分必要条件 【解析】右导数为 φ'(0)+φ(0)，左导数为 φ'(0)−φ(0)，相等当且仅当 φ(0)=0，即 f(0)=0；故充要。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":23}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":24,"recognized_text":"12. 【答案】2f'(x₀) 【解析】用 sin(1/n)~1/n，把分子拆成两个导数定义，第二项因 x_n/(1/n)→1，结果为 2f'(x₀)。\n13. 【答案】(t−5)f'(0) 【解析】奇函数 f(0)=0，f(tx)/x→t f'(0)，5f(x)/x→5f'(0)，故 (t−5)f'(0)。\n14. 【答案】2 【解析】2x=x² 的交点在 x=2；左导数2、右导数4，故不可导点 a=2。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":24}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":25,"recognized_text":"15. 【答案】f(x)={x²+ax+b (x<1); (1+a+b)/6 (x=1); x² (x>1)}；全域连续且可导当且仅当 a=10,b=−5 【解析】按 x<1、x=1、x>1 分段取极限得 f=x²+ax+b (x<1)，f=(1+a+b)/6 (x=1)，f=x² (x>1)。连续要求 a+b=5；左右导数相等给 a/5=2，故 a=10,b=−5。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":25}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":177,"recognized_text":"1. 【答案】A：0 【解析】将 |x³−x²+x|=|x|(x²−x+1)，后因子恒正，仅 x=0 可能不可导；极限差商为0，故可导，个数0。\n2. 【答案】A：αβ 【解析】由 f(x₀)=αf(0) 及 f'(0)=β，并对 f(x+x₀)=αf(x) 求导取 x=0，得 f'(x₀)=αβ。\n3. 【答案】C：可导但 f' 不连续 【解析】连续性由 |x²sin(t/x)|≤x²；导数为2xsin(t/x)−t cos(t/x)，振荡不趋极限，故 C。\n4. 【答案】C：②③ 【解析】①反例 f=x^{2/3}；②直接由导数定义成立；③可导仅给 f(x)=O(x)，除以∛x趋0，故②③。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":177}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":178,"recognized_text":"5. 【答案】B：可导且F'(0)=0 【解析】f(0)=0且 f'(0)=0，链式法则得 F'(0)=g'(0)f'(0)=0；F连续，故 B。\n6. 【答案】B：4e/3 【解析】参数点 x=π/2 对应 t=1，dx/dt=3，f'(π/2)=2e/3；增量为2/n，故极限 n·f'·2/n=4e/3。\n7. 【答案】ba^a 【解析】令差式化为 f(0)^{f'(0)}·[f'(0) (f(x)−f(0))/x]，得 b a^a。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":178}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":179,"recognized_text":"8. 【答案】f'(x)=3xg(x³)−∫_0^{x³}g(u)du/x² (x≠0), f'(0)=0；连续 【解析】换元 u=xt 得 f(x)=x^{-1}∫_0^{x³}g(u)du，求导得给定式；利用连续 g 证明趋0，故 f' 在0连续。\n9. 【答案】0 【解析】若 f'(a)≠0，则左右差商的绝对值符号相反，不可能相等；故必须 f'(a)=0，且此时 |f|可导。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":179}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":180,"recognized_text":"10. 【答案】a=0；f'(0)=(g''(0)−1)/2，x≠0按商法则 【解析】连续极限给 a=g'(0)+1=0；洛必达两次得 f'(0)=(g''(0)−1)/2，x≠0按商法则。\n11. 【答案】g'(x)=[xf'(x)−f(x)]/x² (x≠0), g'(0)=f''(0)/2；连续 【解析】泰勒展开 f(x)=f'(0)x+f''(0)x²/2+o(x²)，故 g'(0)=f''(0)/2；x≠0求导后极限同值，连续。\n12. 【答案】连续、可导，f'(0)=π/2且f'连续 【解析】两侧极限均0，f'(0)=π/2；右侧导数趋π/2，左侧也趋π/2，故 f'连续。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":180}
{"source_id":"src.1000q.solution","pdf_page":181,"recognized_text":"13. 【答案】B：f(a)=0,f'(a)≠0 【解析】绝对值在 f(a)≠0 时局部等于±f；不可导当且仅当 f(a)=0 且 f'(a)≠0。\n14. 【答案】D：f''(0)存在 【解析】(1+x)^x=e^{x ln(1+x)}，f'(0)=0且 f''(0)=2，故 f''存在。\n15. 【答案】−4 【解析】公共切线给 f'(1)=4；差分极限为 −f'(1)=−4。","recognized_formulas":[],"solution_figure_presence":"none_visible","recognition_status":"source_page_confirmed","cursor":181}
